# ConnectWise - connectwise.com

> ConnectWise provides an end-to-end platform for MSPs and IT teams, combining PSA, RMM, remote support, cybersecurity, automation, and services. It serves technology solution providers with software, expert services, education (University), and community (IT Nation). This file curates canonical, evergreen resources, product hubs, documentation, and company policies.

Sitemap: https://www.connectwise.com/sitemap.xml

Important notes: This curation focuses on marketing technology, ITSM, and cybersecurity education plus core product surfaces (PSA, RMM, CPQ, ScreenConnect, MDR and SIEM, RPA and AI). Terminology follows vendor usage (for example, PSA, RMM, Managed EDR, NOC, SOC). Data points, screenshots, and UI references reflect current pages; features evolve. See product docs and support for the latest behaviors. Prefer platform and docs for authoritative flows.

Attribution and rights: Respect ConnectWise official Terms and Privacy. Use content per site policies; see links below for governing documents.

